---
// Split hero: copy, buttons and avatar trust line on the left; abstract artwork with a floating stat card on the right.
---

<section class="bg-bg py-20 sm:py-28">
  <div class="mx-auto grid max-w-6xl items-center gap-14 px-6 lg:grid-cols-2 lg:gap-16">
    <div>
      <p class="text-sm font-semibold tracking-widest text-brand-600 uppercase dark:text-brand-400">Project planning, minus the panic</p>

      <h1 class="mt-5 font-display text-5xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-balance text-fg sm:text-6xl">
        <span>Plan the week.</span>
        <span class="text-brand-600 dark:text-brand-400">Keep the calm.</span>
      </h1>

      <p class="mt-6 max-w-xl text-lg leading-8 text-pretty text-muted">Halcyon turns scattered tasks into one clear weekly plan. Everyone knows what matters today, what can wait, and when the work is actually done.</p>

      <div class="mt-9 flex flex-col gap-3 sm:flex-row">
        <a href="/contact" class="rounded-button bg-brand-600 px-6 py-3 text-center text-base font-semibold text-white shadow-lg shadow-brand-600/25 transition-colors hover:bg-brand-700 focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-brand-500">Start free</a>
        <a href="/pricing" class="rounded-button border border-line px-6 py-3 text-center text-base font-semibold text-fg transition-colors hover:bg-surface">View pricing</a>
      </div>

      <div class="mt-10 flex items-center gap-4">
        <div class="flex -space-x-3">
          <img src="/media/avatar-1.svg" alt="Portrait of a Halcyon customer" width="40" height="40" class="h-10 w-10 rounded-full object-cover ring-2 ring-bg" />
          <img src="/media/avatar-2.svg" alt="Portrait of a Halcyon customer" width="40" height="40" class="h-10 w-10 rounded-full object-cover ring-2 ring-bg" />
          <img src="/media/avatar-3.svg" alt="Portrait of a Halcyon customer" width="40" height="40" class="h-10 w-10 rounded-full object-cover ring-2 ring-bg" />
        </div>
        <p class="text-sm leading-6 text-muted">Loved by 4,200 small teams who would rather build than chase updates.</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="relative">
      <div class="overflow-hidden rounded-card border border-line shadow-2xl shadow-brand-950/15">
        <img src="/media/abstract-2.svg" alt="Soft abstract gradient artwork in Halcyon's brand colours" width="1600" height="1000" class="aspect-[4/5] w-full object-cover sm:aspect-[5/4] lg:aspect-[4/5]" />
      </div>

      <div class="absolute -bottom-6 left-4 w-64 rounded-card border border-line bg-bg p-5 shadow-xl shadow-brand-950/15 sm:-left-8">
        <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
          <p class="text-sm font-medium text-muted">Shipped on time</p>
          <span class="rounded-button bg-brand-50 px-2 py-0.5 text-xs font-semibold text-brand-700 dark:bg-brand-950/40 dark:text-brand-300">+18%</span>
        </div>
        <p class="mt-2 font-display text-4xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-fg">94%</p>
        <div class="mt-4 h-2 overflow-hidden rounded-full bg-surface">
          <div class="h-full w-11/12 rounded-full bg-brand-600"></div>
        </div>
        <p class="mt-3 text-xs text-muted">Average across teams after 90 days</p>
      </div>

      <div class="absolute top-6 right-4 flex items-center gap-3 rounded-button border border-line bg-bg/90 py-2 pr-4 pl-2 shadow-lg shadow-brand-950/10 backdrop-blur sm:-right-4">
        <span class="flex h-8 w-8 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-brand-600 text-white">
          <svg class="h-4 w-4" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
            <path d="M5 12.5l4.5 4.5L19 7.5" />
          </svg>
        </span>
        <span class="text-sm font-medium text-fg">Spring launch is on track</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
